    {
      "id": "CTR-001",
      "kind": "contract",
      "title": "支付网关接口契约",
      "summary": "charge(amount_cents) 成功返回支付流水号；金额非法抛 PaymentError 且不重试。",
      "body": "对外只暴露 charge(amount_cents, timeout_seconds=3, max_retry=3) -> str。\n成功返回形如 PAY-00001001 的流水号；金额非正或 max_retry < 1 抛 PaymentError。\n调用方不得依赖内部重试次数，重试策略由服务端统一控制。",
      "status": "active",
      "version": 1,
      "priority": 10,
      "effective_from": "2026-02-01",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-20",
